<title>USA: U.S. Spring/White Wheat - Spring wheat mixed.</title>
<headline>U.S. Spring/White Wheat - Spring wheat mixed.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dark northern spring wheat bids were mixed Tuesday in mostly quiet dealings, merchandisers said.</p>
<p>The approaching Thanksgiving holiday on Thursday has dampened farmer enthusiasm for selling and helped to keep country movement to a minimum, cash sources said.</p>
<p>&quot;I think everybody's in the pre-holiday kind of mode,&quot; one Minneapolis-based trader said. &quot;It was very quiet today (Tuesday).&quot;</p>
<p>A few dealers noted difficulty placing railcars in position.</p>
<p>One Montana-based dealer noticed a jump in the pace of fresh sales.</p>
<p>&quot;We've seen a little bit more country selling,&quot; the dealer said.  </p>
